# Point-cloud fixtures are BINARY: a LAS/LAZ record stream and a binary PLY.
# Marked explicitly rather than left to Git's NUL-byte heuristic — a binary PLY
# opens with an ASCII header, so a file whose first NUL fell past the sniff
# window could be misdetected as text and have its bytes rewritten by autocrlf,
# which would silently corrupt every offset the reader depends on.
*.las binary
*.laz binary
*.ply binary
